# React / Capacitor (Reader)

## Architecture

- Business logic in `src/lib/` — hooks orchestrate, components render
- API calls only through `src/lib/inpxClient.ts` — never ad-hoc fetch elsewhere
- Heavy tabs lazy-loaded (`React.lazy`)

## Android WebView

- Motion: `reducedMotion="user"`, transform/scale only — never enter via `opacity: 0` (WebView blank risk)
- Flex chain: `min-h-0` on scroll containers
- Dev browser uses `/api/proxy`; APK uses CapacitorHttp direct to server

## Types

- Book/sync types live in `inpxClient.ts` and `src/types.ts`
- New API fields → update types + client method in same PR

## Do Not

- Add iOS/desktop/PWA branches
- Parse FB2/EPUB for metadata when server has `/api/books/:id/meta`
- Modify `server.ts` unless explicitly asked (dev proxy only)
